  "html": "\u003C!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \u0022-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\u0022 \u0022http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\u0022\u003E\n\u003Chtml lang=\u0022pt\u0022\u003E\n  \u003Chead\u003E\n    \u003Cmeta http-equiv=\u0022Content-Type\u0022 content=\u0022text/html charset=UTF-8\u0022 /\u003E\n    \u003Ctitle\u003E\u003C/title\u003E\n  \u003C/head\u003E\n  \u003Cbody\u003E\n    \u003Cp\u003EExmos. Srs.,\u003C/p\u003E\n    \u003Cp\u003EVimos por este meio informar que as seguintes encomendas j\u0026aacute; ultrapassaram o prazo previsto para entrega:\u003C/p\u003E\n    \u003Ctable cellpadding=\u00220\u0022 cellspacing=\u00220\u0022 style=\u0022border-collapse: collapse;\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cthead\u003E\n            \u003Ctr\u003E\n                \u003Cth style=\u0022margin: 0; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #000000\u0022\u003EN.Encomenda\u003C/th\u003E\n                \u003Cth style=\u0022margin: 0; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #000000\u0022\u003EN.Artigo\u003C/th\u003E\n                \u003Cth style=\u0022margin: 0; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #000000\u0022\u003EDescri\u00E7\u00E3o\u003C/th\u003E\n                \u003Cth style=\u0022margin: 0; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #000000\u0022\u003EQt.Falta\u003C/th\u003E\n                \u003Cth style=\u0022margin: 0; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #000000\u0022\u003EUn.\u003C/th\u003E\n                \u003Cth style=\u0022margin: 0; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #000000\u0022\u003EDt.Entrega\u003C/th\u003E\n                \u003Cth style=\u0022margin: 0; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #000000\u0022\u003EAtraso (dias)\u003C/th\u003E\n            \u003C/tr\u003E\n        \u003C/thead\u003E\n        \u003Ctbody\u003E\n            \u003Ctr\u003E\n    \u003Ctd style=\u0022margin: 0; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #000000\u0022\u003EENF-SY022607/0034\u003C/td\u003E\n    \u003Ctd style=\u0022margin: 0; padding: 5px; border: 1px solid #000000\u0022\u003EMC00-00002806\u003C